        <span class="report-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        A yellow dot above a bar means Windows expected an installer file that was not on disk
        before the run started. Nothing about the cleanup caused or worsened that. If Windows
        later asks for the original installer for a piece of software, restore from the Recycle
        Bin if you Deleted, copy it back from your move folder if you Moved, or download the
        installer again from the vendor. Reports last refreshed {reportsAsOf}.
      </p>
